<div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 1.5rem auto;">
  <div class="glass-card sketch-corner">
    <span class="mono-label" style="color: var(--color-red-accent);">Domain Architecture</span>
    <h2 style="margin: 0.25rem 0 1rem;">About MediClinic Care System</h2>

    <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6;">
      <strong>MediClinic Care</strong> is a specialized healthcare appointment management platform built to streamline doctor-patient interactions for small and medium clinics.
    </p>

    <div class="paper-card mt-3" style="background-color: var(--bg-paper);">
      <h4 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Core Healthcare Capabilities</h4>
      <ul style="padding-left: 1.25rem; font-size: 0.88rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem;">
        <li><strong>Role-Based Access Control:</strong> Distinct user flows for Patients (booking & history) and Doctors/Admins (queue & actions).</li>
        <li><strong>Doctor Directory & Search:</strong> Filter doctors by medical specialization or search by name.</li>
        <li><strong>30-Minute Slot Scheduling:</strong> Select date and time slots from 09:00 AM to 05:00 PM.</li>
        <li><strong>Collision Prevention & Auto-Suggest:</strong> Guards against double bookings and automatically recommends the next available slot on conflict.</li>
        <li><strong>Doctor Consultation Actions:</strong> Clinic providers can Accept, Reject, or Mark appointments Completed.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-3">
      <h4>Technology Foundation</h4>
      <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-soft-ink);">
        Powered by Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB Atlas (Mongoose), EJS Server-Side Rendering, and custom Editorial Paper CSS design tokens.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
